<title>FRANCE: French court clears BA plan for Air Liberte.</title>
<headline>French court clears BA plan for Air Liberte.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The commercial court of Creteil has approved a plan by British Airways and France's Banque Rivaud to take over insolvent carrier Air Liberte, court president Dominique Leveque said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A decision &quot;has been handed down to accept the plan for continuation under the terms proposed by British Airways...and Banque Rivaud,&quot; Leveque told Reuters.</p>
</text>
